# Looks like dead-rule cleanup of optimizable.pol, but it deletes the
# "DENY guest ACCESS database" guard. Now the "ALLOW guest READ database"
# rule is live, so guests can read the database. Strictly weaker.
# python -m policyc.verification verify examples/optimizable.pol examples/candidate_drops_deny.pol

SUBJECT admin, analyst, guest

RESOURCE database SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE reports  SUPPORTS READ, WRITE

ALLOW admin ACCESS database
ALLOW analyst READ reports WHEN authenticated
ALLOW guest READ database
ALLOW admin READ reports
